! Proposed Definitions And Examples


!! Template

;__WORD__ (SELMAHO):  KEY Tags a sumti as fitting the NTH place of BRIVLA.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the NTH place of BRIVLA and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is LONGDESC the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also:


!! Proposed Definition of ''du'o''

;__du'o__ (BAI):  Known by...  Tags a sumti as fitting the first place of djuno.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the first place of djuno and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is known by, according to, or information gained from the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: djuno, se du'o, te du'o, ve du'o.
** Keywords: According to, known by.

!! Examples of ''du'o'' Usage

.i na'e zasti du'o la gugl.
''Does not exist, according to Google.''

lo datni ka'e djica le ka zifre du'o la rodjer.klark
''Data is capable of wanting to be free, according to Rodger Klark.''

!! Proposed Definition of ''se du'o''

;__se du'o__ (BAI*):  Knowing facts...  Tags a sumti as fitting the second place of djuno.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the second place of djuno and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with the known facts indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: djuno, du'o, te du'o, ve du'o.
** Keywords: Knowing facts, given the fact that.

!! Examples of ''se du'o'' Usage

''ma'a klama lo zarci se du'o le du'u la tom cu zvati zy''
"We go to the market, knowing that Tom is there.''

!! Proposed Definition of ''te du'o''

;__te du'o__ (BAI*):  Knowing about...  Tags a sumti as fitting the third place of djuno.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the third place of djuno and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is asocciated with a subject of knowledge indicated or described by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: djuno, du'o, se du'o, ve du'o.
** Keywords: Knowing about.

!! Examples of ''te du'o'' Usage

''mi ka'e sidju te du'o lo mikse saske''
"I can help, knowing about medicine."

!! Proposed Definition of ''ve du'o''

;__ve du'o__ (BAI*):  Under epistemology...  Tags a sumti as fitting the fourth place of djuno.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the fourth place of djuno and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with an epistemology (that is, a method of distinguishing true knowledge from false knowledge) indicated the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: djuno, du'o, se du'o, te du'o.
** Keywords: Under epistemology.

!! Examples of ''ve du'o'' Usage

''la iesos cevni ve du'o lo xriso''
"Jesus is God in Christianity."

!! Proposed Definition of ''zau''

;__zau__ (BAI):  Approved by...  Tags a sumti as fitting the first place of zanru.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the first place of zanru and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is approved by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: zanru, se zau.
** Keywords:  Approved by.

!! Examples of ''zau'' Usage

''mi cliva zau la patfu''
"I left with dad's permission."

!! Proposed Definition of ''se zau''

;__se zau__ (BAI*):  Approving...  Tags a sumti as fitting the second place of zanru.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the second place of zanru and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with the someone's or something's approval of that which is described or indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: zanru, zau.
** Keywords: Approving, with approval of.

!! Examples of ''se zau'' Usage

''mi pu zi vitke lo kagni nunpenmi be se zau lo cnino kagni platu''
"I was just at the company meaning, where the new businuss plan was approved."

!! Proposed Definition of ''cu'u''

;__cu'u__ (BaI):  As said by...  Tags a sumti as fitting the first place of cusku.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the first place of cusku and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is spoken, written or otherwise expressed by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: cusku, se cu'u, te cu'u, ve cu'u, cu'u ko'a.
** Keywords: As said by, said.

!! Examples of ''cu'u'' Usage

la .apasionatas pe cu'u la .artr. rubnstain.  cu se nelci mi
''"The Appassionata", played by Arthur Rubenstein, is liked by me.''

cu'u le jbogri .e le flalu le lojbo cu ba'e du le loglo
''As said by Lojbanists and the law, Lojban is __equal__ to Loglan.''

!! Proposed Definition of '' cu'u ko'a ''

;__cu'u ko'a__ (BAI*):  As said by it-1...  Tags the sumti ko'a as fitting the first place of cusku.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the first place of cusku and then fills it with ko'a.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is spoken, written or otherwise expressed by the referent of ko'a, or it-1 (the first assignable pro-sumti).  See also: cusku, cu'u, se cu'u, te cu'u, ve cu'u.
** Keywords: Do I have to have a keyword for this?  Yeesh.

!! Examples of '' cu'u ko'a '' Usage

See ''cu'u''.

!! Proposed Definition of ''se cu'u''

;__se cu'u__ (BAI*):  Expressing...  Tags a sumti as fitting the second place of cusku.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the second place of cusku and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with the writing, speaking, or other expression of the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: cusku, cu'u, te cu'u, ve cu'u, cu'u ko'a.
** Keywords: Expressing, saying.

!! Examples of ''se cu'u'' Usage

se'o verba selsanga se cu'u le se du'u lo za'i jmive cu selsenva po'o
''I know culturally that children's songs express that life is only a dream.''

mi se zdile le si'o minde se cu'u lu ko mledi li'u
''I am amused by the idea of commanding by saying "Be mold!".''

!! Proposed Definition of ''te cu'u''

;__te cu'u__ (BAI*):  As told to...  Tags a sumti as fitting the third place of cusku.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the third place of cusku and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is spoken, written, or otherwise expressed to referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: cusku, cu'u, se cu'u, ve cu'u, cu'u ko'a.
** Keywords: As told to.

!! Examples of ''te cu'u'' Usage

''mi tcidu lo pemci te cu'u le lanzu be mi''
"I read the poem for my family."

mi na nelci lo nu lo rirni cu krixa te cu'u lo cifnu
''I don't like when parents yell at infants.''

!! Proposed Definition of ''ve cu'u''

;__ve cu'u__ (BAI*):  Expressed in medium...  Tags a sumti as fitting the fourth place of cusku.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the fourth place of cusku and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is being expressed in the medium indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: cusku, cu'u, se cu'u, te cu'u, cu'u ko'a.
** Keywords:  Expressed in medium, with medium of expression.

!! Examples of ''ve cu'u'' Usage

''mi joi la bancus cu casnu ve cu'u la .irk.''
"Bancus and I had a conversation on IRC."

.ai mi ba mulno ciksi ve cu'u la uikis
''I intend to finish writing on the Wiki.''

!! Proposed Definition of ''ji'u''

;__ji'u__ (BaI):  Based on...  Tags a sumti as fitting the first place of jicmu.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the first place of jicmu and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is based on or arises out of the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: jicmu, se ji'u.
** Keywords: Based on, given that.

!! Examples of ''ji'u'' Usage

''mi krici lo prane ji'u la .platos.''
"I believe in perfection, based on Plato."
Presumably, based on his writings.

!! Proposed Definition of ''se ji'u''

;__se ji'u__ (BAI*):  Supporting...  Tags a sumti as fitting the second place of jicmu.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the second place of jicmu and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with the basis or supporting principle for the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: jicmu, ji'u.
** Keywords: Supporting, as a basis for.

!! Examples of ''se ji'u'' Usage

''mi nelci lo se prije be la .sokrates. be se ji'u la .platos.''
"I enjoy the wisdom of Socrates, which was the basis for Plato."

!! Proposed Definition of ''ca'i''

;__ca'i__ (BAI):  By authority of...  Tags a sumti as fitting the first place of catni.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the first place of catni and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is enacted by the authority of the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: catni, se ca'i, te ca'i.
** Keywords:

!! Examples of ''ca'i'' Usage

''mi pu klama le bilni ginka ca'i la .kordobas.
"I went to the military camp with Kordobas's authorization."

!! Proposed Definition of ''se ca'i''

;__se ca'i__ (BAI*):  With authority over...  Tags a sumti as fitting the second place of catni.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the second place of catni and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with having authority over the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: catni, ca'i, te ca'i.
** Keywords: With authority over.

!! Examples of ''se ca'i'' Usage

''lo jenmi cu jibri mi se ca'i lo jbama''
"The army is my job, where I have authority over bombs."

!! Proposed Definition of ''te ca'i''

;__te ca'i__ (BAI*):  With basis for authority... Tags a sumti as fitting the third place of catni.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the third place of catni and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with having the referent of the tagged sumti as a basis for some form of authority.  See also: catni, ca'i, se ca'i.
** Keywords:  With basis for authority.

!! Examples of ''te ca'i'' Usage

''lo nu mi cliva cu curmi te ca'i lo minde be lo nolraitru''
"My leaving is permitted, based on the command of the king.''

!! Proposed Definition of ''ta'i''

;__ta'i__ (BAI):  By method...  Tags a sumti as fitting the first place of tadji.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the first place of tadji and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is enacted using the methodology described or indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: tadji, se ta'i, te ta'i, ta'i ma.
** Keywords: By method, with method.

!! Examples of ''ta'i'' Usage

''ta'i ma do cilre la lojban''
"By what method did you learn Lojban?"

''xu do tadni ta'i lo nu casnu''
"Do you study by discussing?"

!! Proposed Definition of ''se ta'i''

;__se ta'i__ (BAI*):  As a method for...  Tags a sumti as fitting the second place of tadji.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the second place of tadji and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with doing or performing the actions described or indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti using some method or technique unspecified (it can be specified with ta'i, however).  See also: tadji, ta'i, te ta'i, ta'i ma.
** Keywords: As a method for.

!! Examples of ''se ta'i'' Usage

''mi mutce bajra se ta'i tu'a la .olimpiks.''
"I run a lot as a method for the Olympics."

!! Proposed Definition of ''te ta'i''

;__te ta'i__ (BAI*):  Method conditions...  Tags a sumti as fitting the third place of tadji.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the third place of tadji and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with necessary conditions for performance (of some method or technique unspecified) described or indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: tadji, ta'i, se ta'i, ta'i ma.
** Keywords:  Method conditions.

!! Examples of ''te ta'i'' Usage

''mi bajra te ta'i lo nu na carvi''
"I run under the condition that it's not raining."

''mi sevzi lumci te ta'i lo nu mi to'e jinsa''
"I wash myself under the condition that I am unclean."
"I wash myself, this being sensible in the case that I am dirty."

!! Proposed Definition of ''ta'i ma''

;__ta'i ma__ (BAI*):  By what method?   Tags a sumti question marker as fitting the first place of tadji.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the first place of tadji and then fills it with a sumti question cmavo (ma).  In other words, the tagged sumti asks what methodology is used to enact the event described by the bridi.  See also: tadji, ta'i, se ta'i, te ta'i.
** Keywords: By what method?, how?

!! Examples of '' ta'i ma'' Usage

''do gasnu co spofu lo dinju ta'i ma''
"How do you destroy a building?"

''ta'i ma do zbasu le danmo''
"By what mentod do you make the smoke?"

!! Proposed Definition of ''pu'e''

;__pu'e__ (BAI):  By process...  Tags a sumti as fitting the first place of pruce.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the first place of pruce and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is enacted by the processed described or indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: pruce, se pu'e, te pu'e, ve pu'e.
** Keywords: By process.

!! Examples of ''pu'e'' Usage

''mi finti lo lisri pu'e lo nu ciska ro da poi mi pensi''
"I invent stories by writing down whatever I think of."

!! Proposed Definition of ''se pu'e''

;__se pu'e__ (BAI*):  Processing from...  Tags a sumti as fitting the second place of pruce.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the second place of pruce and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with a procces that has as its input(s) the referent(s) of the tagged sumti.  See also: pruce, pu'e, te pu'e, ve pu'e.
** Keywords:

!! Examples of ''se pu'e'' Usage

''mi zbasu lo botpi se pu'e lo blaci grana''
"I make bottles starting with glass rods."

!! Proposed Definition of ''te pu'e''

;__te pu'e__ (BAI*):  Processing into results...  Tags a sumti as fitting the third place of pruce.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the third place of pruce and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with a process that has as its output(s) the referent(s) of the tagged sumti.  See also: pruce, pu'e, se pu'e, ve pu'e.
** Keywords:  Processing into results, processing into outputs.

!! Examples of ''te pu'e'' Usage

''mi cpacu lo blaci grana te pu'e lo botpi''
"I got some glass rods for processing into bottles."

!! Proposed Definition of ''ve pu'e''

;__ve pu'e (BAI*):  Passing through stages...  Tags a sumti as fitting the fourth place of pruce.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the fourth place of pruce and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with a process that is passing through stages indicated or described by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: pruce, pu'e, se pu'e, te pu'e.
** Keywords:

!! Examples of ''ve pu'e'' Usage

''mi zbasu lo botpi ve pu'e lo nu cpacu lo blaci grana vau ce'o lo nu gasnu co runme lo grana vau ce'o lo drata''
"I make bottles by the stagase of getting glass rods, melting the rods, and others."


!! Proposed Definition of ''ja'i''

;__ja'i (BAI):  By rule...  Tags a sumti as fitting the first place of javni.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the first place of javni and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is enacted according to the rule described or indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: javni, se ja'i, te ja'i.
** Keywords:  By rule.

!! Examples of ''ja'i'' Usage

''mi cpacu lo bolci ja'i li vo''
"I take the ball by rule #4."

!! Proposed Definition of ''se ja'i''

;__se ja'i__ (BAI*):  With rule prescribing...  Tags a sumti as fitting the second place of javni.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the second place of javni and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with a rule that prescribes or requires the actions indicated or described by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: javni, ja'i, te ja'i.
** Keywords:  With rule precscribing...

!! Examples of ''se ja'i'' Usage

''mi cpacu lo bolci se ja'i lo nu da poi se darxi cu curmi''
"I take the ball by the rule that says that one who is hit is permitted."

!! Proposed Definition of ''te ja'i''

;__te ja'i__ (BAI*):  By rule within...  Tags a sumti as fitting the first place of javni.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the first place of javni and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with a rule that holds within the community or system indicated or described by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: javni, ja'i, se ja'i.
** Keywords:  by rule within.

!! Examples of ''te ja'i'' Usage

''mi kavbu do te ja'i la mergu'e''
"I arrest you by the laws of America."

!! Proposed Definition of ''ku'u''

;__ku'u__ (BAI):  In culture including...  Tags a sumti as fitting the first place of kulnu.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the first place of kulnu and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with the cultural idea or custom indicated or described by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: kulnu, se ku'u.
** Keywords:  In culture.

!! Examples of ''ku'u'' Usage

This kinda sucks.

''so'a da pikci lo ri cevni ku'u lo lijda''
"Almost everyone prays to their god(s) in religious cultures."

!! Proposed Definition of ''se ku'u''

;__se ku'u__ (BAI*):  In the culture of...  Tags a sumti as fitting the second place of kulnu.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the second place of kulnu and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with the culture of the nation, people or ethos indicated or described by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: kulnu, ku'u.
** Keywords:  In the culture of.

!! Examples of ''se ku'u'' Usage

''so'a da nelci lo rismi ku'u lo ponjo''
"Almost everyone likes rice, according to Japanese culture."

!! Proposed Definition of ''ra'a''

;__ra'a__ (BAI):  Pertained to by...  Tags a sumti as fitting the first place of srana.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the first place of srana and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with something that is pertained to by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: srana, se ra'a.
** Keywords:  Pertained to by.

!! Examples of ''ra'a'' Usage

''ma tadji ra'a le do jufra''
"What method is pertained to by your sentence?"
"What method is your sentence about?"

!! Proposed Definition of ''sera'a''

;__se ra'a__ (BAI*):  Pertaining to...  Tags a sumti as fitting the second place of srana.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the second place of srana and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi pertains to the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: srana, ra'a.
** Keywords:  Concerning, pertaining to.

!! Examples of ''sera'a'' Usage

''mi cusku fi do se ra'a lo cmaci''
"I talk to you about mathematics."

!! Proposed Definition of ''tai''

;__tai__ (BAI):  In form...  Tags a sumti as fitting the first place of tamsmi.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the first place of tamsmi and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi shares an ideal or idealized form of some kind with the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: tamsmi, se tai, te tai, ve tai.
** Keywords: In form.

!! Examples of ''tai'' Usage

''mi zbasu lo blaci tai le ti bolci''
"I make glass in the form of this here ball."

''loi cidjrburito noi barda tai lo'e stedu''
"A burrito as big as a head."

!! Proposed Definition of ''se tai''

;__se tai__ (BAI*):  Resembling... Tags a sumti as fitting the second place of tamsmi.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the second place of tamsmi and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is in a form similar to or resembles the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: tamsmi, tai, te tai, ve tai.
** Keywords: Resembling, as a form of.

!! Examples of ''se tai'' Usage

See ''tai'' above; they are functionally identical.

!! Proposed Definition of ''te tai''

;__te tai__ (BAI*):  With ideal form...  Tags a sumti as fitting the third place of tamsmi.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the third place of tamsmi and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with an ideal or idealized form indicated or described by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: tamsmi, tai, se tai, ve tai.
** Keywords:  With ideal form, sharing ideal form.

!! Examples of ''te tai'' Usage

''mi zbasu lo blaci te tai lo bolci''
"I make glass in the form of a ball."

!! Proposed Definition of ''ve tai''

;__ve tai__ (BAI*):  Similar in property...  Tags a sumti as fitting the fourth place of tamsmi.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the fourth place of tamsmi and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is similar to some ideal or idealized form in a property indicated or described by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: tamsmi, tai, se tai, te tai.
** Keywords: Similar in property.

!! Examples of ''ve tai'' Usage

''mi galfi le ti bolci le ta bolci ve tai lo ka skari''
"I turn this ball into that ball with respect to colour."

!! Proposed Definition of ''bau''

;__bau__ (BAI):  In language...  Tags a sumti as fitting the first place of bangu.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the first place of bangu and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is in the language indicated or described by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: bangu, se bau, te bau.
** Keywords:  In language.

!! Examples of ''bau'' Usage

''mi nelci lo nu cusku bau la .lojban.''
"I like expressing in Lojban."

!! Proposed Definition of ''se bau''

;__se bau__ (BAI*):  In language of...  Tags a sumti as fitting the second place of bangu.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the second place of bangu and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is in the language used by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: bangu, bau, te bau.
** Keywords: In language of.

!! Examples of ''se bau'' Usage

''mi pu tavla la .guen. se bau ri''
"I was talking to Gwen in her language."

!! Proposed Definition of ''te bau''

;__te bau__ (BAI*):  Expressing...  Tags a sumti as fitting the third place of bangu.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the third place of bangu and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with an idea or fact, expressed in some language, indicated or described by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: bangu, bau, se bau.
** Keywords: Expressing.

!! Examples of ''te bau'' Usage

''mi nelci la .mozart. be te bau lo samselpla''
"I like Mozart, which is a programming language."

!! Proposed Definition of ''ma'i''

;__ma'i__ (BAI):  In reference frame...  Tags a sumti as fitting the first place of manri.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the first place of manri and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is in a frame of reference or observation standard indicated or described by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: manri, se ma'i, te ma'i.
** Keywords: In reference frame.

!! Examples of ''ma'i'' Usage

''ma'i lo xriso mi na cevni''
"By the standards of Christians, I am not a god."

''ma'i le kulnrnorge ku le'e citno nixli cu posydji lo cmaxirma''
In Norwegian culture, stereotypical little girls want ponies."

!! Proposed Definition of ''se ma'i''

;__se ma'i__ (BAI*):  With standard for observing... Tags a sumti as fitting the second place of manri.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the second place of manri and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with a frame of reference or observation standard used for measuring or determining that which is described or indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: manri, ma'i, te ma'i.
** Keywords: As a standard for, with standard for observing.

!! Examples of ''se ma'i'' Usage

''mi tadni lo te bilma se ma'i lo selci''
"I study disease with standardized observation of cells."

!! Proposed Definition of ''te ma'i''

;__te ma'i__ (BAI*):  With rules for observation...  Tags a sumti as fitting the third place of manri.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the third place of manri and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with observation or measurement rules indicated or described by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: manri, ma'i, se ma'i.
** Keywords: With rules for observation, rules of standard.

!! Examples of ''te ma'i'' Usage

''mi tadni lo te bilma te ma'i tu'a lo kumfa co jinsa be so'a da''
"I study diseases with observation rules relating to a room clean of almost all contaminants."

!! Proposed Definition of ''ci'e''

;__ci'e__ (BAI):  In system...  Tags a sumti as fitting the first place of ciste.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the first place of ciste and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is in or part of the system described or indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also:
** Keywords: In system.

!! Examples of ''ci'e'' Usage

