"The monitor is connected to the motherboard in the system of my computer."

''lo li'i bau cusku cu sidju lo li'i pensi ci'e lo logji''
"The experience of linguistically expressing helps the experience of thinking in logical systems."

!! Proposed Definition of ''se ci'e''

;__se ci'e__ (BAI*):  With system structure...  Tags a sumti as fitting the second place of ciste.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the second place of ciste and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with a system whose structure is described or indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also:
** Keywords:  With system structure, with system function.

!! Examples of ''se ci'e'' Usage

