"I invent computer programs with a hierarchical structure."

!! Proposed Definition of ''te ci'e''

;__te ci'e__ (BAI*):  Of system components...  Tags a sumti as fitting the third place of ciste.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the third place of ciste and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is part of the set of system components described or indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also:
** Keywords: Of system components.

