"I attach my computer to the school's network of math department computers."

!! Proposed Definition of ''ve ci'e''

;__ve ci'e__ (BAI*):  With synergy in...  Tags a sumti as fitting the fourth place of ciste.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the fourth place of ciste and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with a system that has synergistic or emergent properties described or indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also:
** Keywords: With synergy in.

!! Examples of ''ve ci'e'' Usage

