"I'll describe the computer system to you, but I suggest you not try to use it."

!! Proposed Definition of ''te ti'i''

;__te ti'i__ (BAI*):  Suggested to...  Tags a sumti as fitting the third place of stidi.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the third place of stidi and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is a suggestion made to the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: stidi, ti'i, se ti'i.
** Keywords: Suggested to.

!! Examples of ''te ti'i'' Usage

