"I described STDs as a suggestion to the students."

!! Proposed Definition of ''ga'a''

;__ga'a__ (BAI):  To observer...  Tags a sumti as fitting the first place of zgana.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the first place of zgana and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is perceived by an observer described or indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: zgana, se ga'a, te ga'a, ve ga'a.
