!! Proposed Definition of ''se ga'a''

;__se ga'a__ (BAI*):  Observing...  Tags a sumti as fitting the second place of zgana.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the second place of zgana and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with the observation of the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: zgana, ga'a, te ga'a, ve ga'a.
