''.u'i mi .e do doi tal. cu mutce le'o zei cinmo sega'a le cabdei samymri''

!! Proposed Definition of ''te ga'a''

;__te ga'a__ (BAI*):  Observed by means...  Tags a sumti as fitting the third place of zgana.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the third place of zgana and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with an observation performed in a fashion indicated or described by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: zgana, ga'a, se ga'a, ve ga'a.
