;__ve ga'a__ (BAI*):  Observed under conditions... Tags a sumti as fitting the fourth place of zgana.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the fourth place of zgana and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with an observation made under the conditions indicated or described by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: zgana, ga'a, se ga'a, te ga'a.
