!! Proposed Definition of ''ji'o''

;__ji'o__ (BAI):  Under the diection of...  Tags a sumti as fitting the first place of jitro.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the first place of jitro and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is undertaken under the direction or control of the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: jitro, se ji'o, te ji'o.
